/E (The EATALY Staff and Administration Portal provides a centralized platform for canteen operators and administrators to efficiently manage food preparation, order processing, and campus-wide distribution activities. Staff members securely authenticate using their institutional credentials and employee verification, ensuring that only authorized personnel can access the portal. The interface supports bilingual operation \(English and Tamil\), allowing staff to conveniently use the system in their preferred language. Live orders are categorized into different stages such as Pending, Preparing, Ready for Pickup, Completed, and Cancelled, enabling kitchen staff to monitor preparation progress and update order status in real time. Each order displays essential details including token number, pickup slot, ordered items, payment status, and customer information, ensuring accurate and organized order handling.)
/Pg 40 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
