/E (Different testing scenarios, including normal operation, peak-hour demand, slot saturation, and simultaneous order placement, were executed to assess system performance. During each experiment, parameters such as order processing time, token generation accuracy, synchronization delay, crowd prediction updates, and smart load balancing recommendations were observed. The experimental results demonstrated that EATALY efficiently handled concurrent requests, maintained real-time order tracking, optimized canteen workload distribution, and significantly improved the campus food ordering experience through intelligent queue and crowd management.)
/Pg 52 0 R
/K [2]
