639 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 259 0 R
/T (The experimental results demonstrated that the smart load balancing module effectively redistributed users from highly congested canteens to nearby alternatives with lower waiting times, reducing queue concentration during peak periods. The pickup slot allocation mechanism prevented overcrowding at service counters by evenly distributing collection timings, while the digital token system provided accurate real-time order tracking and minimized manual verification. The bilingual interface further improved usability for both students and staff, ensuring consistent interaction across English and Tamil users.)
/E (The experimental results demonstrated that the smart load balancing module effectively redistributed users from highly congested canteens to nearby alternatives with lower waiting times, reducing queue concentration during peak periods. The pickup slot allocation mechanism prevented overcrowding at service counters by evenly distributing collection timings, while the digital token system provided accurate real-time order tracking and minimized manual verification. The bilingual interface further improved usability for both students and staff, ensuring consistent interaction across English and Tamil users.)
/Pg 54 0 R
/K [2]
>>
