/Title (Overall, the proposed EATALY framework showed significant improvements in operational efficiency, faster order processing, balanced kitchen workload, and enhanced user experience compared to conventional first-come-first-served canteen management. These results indicate that integrating predictive queue analytics, intelligent load balancing, and digital order management can substantially improve food service operations within a university campus.)
/Dest [54 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 1629 0 R
/Next 1620 0 R
>>
