/Title (EATALY has potential applications in universities, colleges, corporate campuses, hospitals, and other institutions that operate multiple food outlets. The system enables students and staff to conveniently order food, monitor queue conditions, and collect meals efficiently through a digital platform. Administrators can utilize analytical insights to support decision-making, monitor operational performance, and improve service quality. Although the current implementation is focused on campus food services, the proposed architecture is scalable and can be extended to larger food service environments with advanced analytics, IoT-based inventory monitoring, and AI-driven operational optimization.)
/Dest [21 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 1648 0 R
/Next 1654 0 R
>>
endobj
